  "description": "Randomly select a finger among the fingers placed on the screen! Great for board games, card games, parties, and every \"who goes first?\" moment.\n\nTHE ORIGINAL FINGER CHOOSER\n\u2022 Everyone places a finger on the screen \u2014 Chooser picks the winner\n\u2022 Multiple winners, ranked results, or split everyone into teams\n\u2022 Tap Style: everyone taps once to join, then let fate decide\n\nPLAY ONLINE WITH FRIENDS\n\u2022 Create a room and share the code, or match with random players\n\u2022 Truth or Dare and dare challenges built for playing together from anywhere\n\u2022 Win a dare? Record a video of it and the whole room watches together\n\u2022 No rooms open? Jump into a quick round against AI\n\u2022 Room chat, custom names and colors, and a live shared finger canvas\n\nTRUTH OR DARE & PARTY GAMES\n\u2022 Thousands of truths, dares, and challenges across 10+ categories\n\u2022 Rate cards with a thumbs-up or down \u2014 Chooser learns what you love\n\u2022 Fresh content added all the time, no update needed\n\nMORE WAYS TO DECIDE\n\u2022 Spin the customizable roulette wheel\n\u2022 Flip a coin, roll 3D dice, pick a number, or spin the arrow\n\u2022 Available in 55 languages\n\nPrivacy Policy: https://visionarystudio.app/privacy-policy/\nTerms of Use: https://visionarystudio.app/term-of-use/",
