  "currency": "USD",
  "description": "Turn any idea into a real, full song \u2014 in seconds. Describe what you want to hear, pick a genre, and AI Music writes the lyrics, sings the vocals, produces the track, and even designs the cover art. No instruments, no studio, no experience needed.\n\nHOW IT WORKS\n1. Describe your song \u2014 a feeling, a story, a person, a moment. As simple or detailed as you like.\n2. Pick your style \u2014 Pop, Rap, Rock, R&B, Electronic, Jazz, Country, Latina, Reggae, Techno, House, Metal and many more.\n3. Get your song \u2014 complete with vocals, lyrics, and unique cover art. Ready to play, save, and share.\n\nTWO WAYS TO CREATE\n\u2022 Simple mode: one short prompt is all it takes. Need a spark? Tap an inspiration idea and go.\n\u2022 Custom mode: bring your own lyrics, name your song, and set the exact style you want. Your words, your music.\n\nWHY YOU'LL LOVE IT\n\u2022 Full songs, not loops \u2014 verses, chorus, real vocals or instrumental\n\u2022 20+ genres to explore, from Hip-Hop to Gospel to Dubstep\n\u2022 Time-synced lyrics \u2014 follow every word karaoke-style as your song plays\n\u2022 Unique AI cover art generated for every track\n\u2022 Your personal library \u2014 play, manage, and revisit all your creations\n\u2022 Share anywhere \u2014 send your songs to friends or post them on social media\n\u2022 Get notified the moment your song is ready\n\u2022 Keep listening in the background, on AirPlay, or in your car\n\nPERFECT FOR\n\u2022 Birthday and anniversary surprises that beat any greeting card\n\u2022 Songs for your partner, your kids, your best friend \u2014 or your pet\n\u2022 Content for TikTok, Reels, and YouTube\n\u2022 Party anthems, road-trip soundtracks, study beats\n\u2022 Songwriters sketching ideas in seconds instead of hours\n\nWhether you're a total beginner or a musician hunting for inspiration, AI Music turns what's in your head into music you can actually hear \u2014 and share with the world.\n\nDownload AI Music now and create your first song today.\n\nPrivacy Policy: https://www.funky-monkey-apps.com/privacy-policy\nTerms of Use: https://www.funky-monkey-apps.com/term-of-us",
