  "description": "Capture every moment with verified date, time, GPS location & watermark \u2014 stamped right on your photo or video in real time. Trusted by workers, inspectors, contractors, travelers and families who need proof that can't be disputed. REAL-TIME TIMESTAMP CAMERA\nTake photos and record videos with the exact date, time, GPS address and custom watermark burned directly onto the image \u2014 no editing needed afterwards. Every stamp is authentic and can't be faked by changing your phone's clock. WHAT YOU CAN DO\n\nAdd date, time & GPS address to any photo or video in real time\nStamp photos from your existing library (add timestamp to old photos)\nChoose from multiple timestamp formats, fonts, colors and sizes\nAdd custom captions and personal watermarks to protect your images\nBatch stamp multiple photos at once \u2014 save hours of manual work\nShare stamped photos instantly via Messages, Email or social media\niMessage app integration for quick sharing\n PERFECT FOR PROFESSIONALS\n\nConstruction & field workers: document job-site progress with date-stamped evidence\nProperty managers & real estate: before/after photo documentation\nDelivery & logistics: timestamped delivery confirmation photos\nLaw enforcement & inspectors: tamper-evident photo records\nFreelancers & contractors: timestamped work reports\nPERFECT FOR PERSONAL USE\n\nTravel photography: remember exactly when and where every photo was taken\nFamily memories: add meaningful dates to your most precious moments\nFood & lifestyle blogging: authentic, dated content\nDaily journaling: create a visual timeline of your life\nWHY CHOOSE TIMESTAMP CAMERA DATE STAMPER?\n\nSimple, clean interface \u2014 no learning curve\nWorks on photos AND videos\nCustom fonts, colors and positioning for every stamp\nGPS location auto-detected \u2014 no manual entry needed\nBulk edit support \u2014 stamp hundreds of photos at once\niMessage App integration for fast team sharing\n\n\nRead our terms at\nhttps://bon-app.net/privacy-policy/\n\nPrivacy Policy:\nhttps://bon-app.net/privacy-policy/\n\nExperience the art of timestamping with Timestamp - Camera Stamper, where every photo tells a story, and every story is marked in time. Download now and start capturing moments with an everlasting impression!",
